{"3726250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Little Cafe Nightmare", "steam_appid": 3726250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4791920], "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Cluttermancer Now</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/23bb5efc0b7d3132f961ac8f3ad7e0e1.poster.avif?t=1787580959\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/23bb5efc0b7d3132f961ac8f3ad7e0e1.webm?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/23bb5efc0b7d3132f961ac8f3ad7e0e1.mp4?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/91ebadd1572f420a3ab6b59efd2052f6.poster.avif?t=1787580959\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/91ebadd1572f420a3ab6b59efd2052f6.webm?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/91ebadd1572f420a3ab6b59efd2052f6.mp4?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/c504e41bcb6c74a6ed6d72bd20ac1777.avif?t=1787580959\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras_big/c504e41bcb6c74a6ed6d72bd20ac1777.avif?t=1787580959 width=1560 height=416 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over a crumbling, haunted café and transform it into a sanctuary for monstrous guests. Restore, decorate, and expand while brewing strange coffees, stocking supplies, and keeping hostile anomalies at bay. My Little Cafe Nightmare is a dark yet cozy first-person café sim where every cup matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/59c3dc0426d9f84c0e962dbb5374cdac.poster.avif?t=1787580959\" width=1080 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/59c3dc0426d9f84c0e962dbb5374cdac.webm?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/59c3dc0426d9f84c0e962dbb5374cdac.mp4?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RENOVATE &amp; CUSTOMIZE YOUR CAFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathe new life into a forgotten café. Repair the rot, decorate with care, and expand your space to create a warm refuge for wandering creatures of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/94c8d586e95bc68c4368d216ab8452dc.poster.avif?t=1787580959\" width=1080 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/94c8d586e95bc68c4368d216ab8452dc.webm?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/94c8d586e95bc68c4368d216ab8452dc.mp4?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREW OTHERWORLDLY COFFEE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft hauntingly good drinks with unique flavours to satisfy the peculiar cravings of your ghostly visitors. Each guest has their own taste, and only the right brew will earn their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/72319dd036c8b6cc8d4dcb168494872b.poster.avif?t=1787580959\" width=1080 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/72319dd036c8b6cc8d4dcb168494872b.webm?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/72319dd036c8b6cc8d4dcb168494872b.mp4?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR LOGISTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage ingredients, cups, and equipment carefully. Order supplies, keep your storage tidy, and make sure your café can withstand the endless demand of spectral customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/43ff519d882cdd7360fcb1d554532abd.poster.avif?t=1787580959\" width=1080 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/43ff519d882cdd7360fcb1d554532abd.webm?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726250/extras/43ff519d882cdd7360fcb1d554532abd.mp4?t=1787580959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over a crumbling, haunted café and transform it into a sanctuary for monstrous guests. Restore, decorate, and expand while brewing